          "items": [
            "1 Kayak | Free WiFi | Outdoor Seating | Keyless Entry<br><br>Beach days and family fun are effortless at this 3-bedroom, 2.5-bath home, stocked with at-home comforts. Located near local restaurants, Inlet Beach, and various state parks and attractions, this vacation rental puts everything you need at your fingertips. When you’re not roaming along the coast, find yourself relaxing in the vacation rental’s backyard - the perfect place for a cookout and quality time by the fire.<br><br>-- THE PROPERTY --<br><br>STR2024-040786<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS<br>- Bedroom 1: 1 king bed<br>- Bedroom 2: 1 queen bed<br>- Bedroom 3 (Connected to Bedroom 2): 1 twin/full bun bed<br>- Living Room: 1 sleeper sofa<br><br>BEACH ESSENTIALS<br>- 4 chairs & umbrella<br>- Inflatable kayak, wagon<br><br>KITCHEN<br>- Stove/oven, refrigerator, microwave, dishwasher<br>- Drip & Keurig coffee makers, blender<br>- Cooking basics, trash bags/paper towels, dishware & flatware<br><br>INDOOR LIVING<br>- 3 Smart TVs<br>- Dining table, games<br><br>OUTDOOR LIVING<br>- Gas grill, fire pit<br>- Shower<br>- Dining table, fenced-in yard<br><br>GENERAL<br>- Central heating & A/C<br>- Washer/dryer<br>- Linens/towels, hair dryer<br><br>FAQ<br>- Ring doorbell (facing out)<br>- Quiet hours (10:00 PM to 8:00 AM)<br>- Pet fee (paid pre-trip)<br><br>ACCESSIBILITY<br>- 2-story home, 1 exterior step to enter<br>- Bedrooms on 2nd floor<br><br>PARKING<br>- Driveway (2 vehicles)<br><br>-- THE LOCATION --<br><br>- Walk to shopping and dining on 30A<br>- 0.3 miles to Inlet Beach Access<br>- 1 mile to Camp Helen State Park & Rosemary Beach<br>- 14 miles to Panama City Beach<br>- 20 miles to Northwest Florida Beaches International Airport<br><br>-- REST EASY WITH US --<br><br>Evolve makes it easy to find and book properties you'll never want to leave. You can relax knowing that our properties will always be ready for you and that we'll answer the phone 24/7. Even better, if anything is off about your stay, we'll make it right. You can count on our homes and our people to make you feel welcome — because we know what vacation means to you.<br><br>-- POLICIES --<br><br>- No smoking <br>- Pet friendly with a $350 fee (+ fees & taxes, dogs only, max 2 allowed)<br>- No events, parties or large gatherings <br>- Must be at least 25 years old to book<br>- Additional fees and taxes may apply<br>- Photo ID may be required upon check-in<br><br>ADDITIONAL INFORMATION<br>- Please observe quiet hours from 10:00 PM to 8:00 AM<br>- This 2-story home requires 1 exterior step to enter and an interior staircase to access all 3 bedrooms on the 2nd floor<br>- Your safety matters. This property features a Ring Doorbell device with an exterior security camera facing the front outdoor entry. The camera does not look into any interior spaces. The camera actively records video when motion is detected by the device (including devices linked to the camera such as the alarm system’s motion detector) or when the video doorbell button is pressed",
